  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.2\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.2 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.1\n- Synchronized package version with the preview10 release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview9\n- Initial release. Replaces FireForNet.Firebase.Auth.Blazor.WebAssembly.\n- IJSRuntime-based token storage (localStorage, sessionStorage), OAuth popup flow, and AuthenticationStateProvider for all Blazor hosting models (WASM, Server, Hybrid, Auto).\n- UseBlazor() extension method on FirebaseAuthBuilder for service registration.\n- No dependency on FireForNet.Firebase.Auth.Browser — references core Auth package directly.\n- JS modules are identical to the Browser package (shared ES module exports).",
